  "title": "Jay's Jerk Chicken",
  "description": "This jerk chicken is marinaded in a fragrant mixture of spices, chiles, garlic, and thyme, then grilled for a hot, sweet, and smoky Jamaican treat.",
  "authors": [
    "KIBADA22"
  ],
